      "payload": "tree 4cc37e39728bd873e9d3038300bef4eb6332872c\nparent c85d47a0099ae2cfec9ac290bc37533dcc6c2da3\nauthor Giuseppe Salvatore <giuseppe.salvatore@shielded.io> 1791189827 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791189827 +0100\n\nchore(qa): clear the high braces audit advisory (#1638)\n\nGHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm (braces <= 3.0.3, high) has no patched release,\nso an override cannot clear it. braces only reached qa/tests through\nlint-staged > micromatch. lint-staged 16.4.0 replaces micromatch with\npicomatch 4, which drops braces from the tree entirely. Same Node\nfloor (>= 20.17) as the 16.x line.\n\n\nAssisted-by: AI <noreply@ai-assistant>\n\nSigned-off-by: Giuseppe Salvatore <giuseppe.salvatore@shielded.io>",
      "verified_at": "2026-10-05T08:43:48Z"
